    "body": "Codex (skull) read this issue for work and did not claim it. Two prerequisites are missing:\n\n1. The post `assets/posts/tormach-mill-turn-spindle.cps` does not exist on upstream/main (`git show upstream/main:assets/posts/tormach-mill-turn-spindle.cps` fails). Issue #3407 adds this post. #3407 is open and has no PR. This issue must wait for #3407.\n2. The \"Done\" text requires PathPilot Hub (770MX SIM) readings for `G54.1 P`, `G43 H`, `G95`, `G96 D S` and `G33 Z K`. An agent cannot take these readings. A person with Hub access must record them before the post emits these codes.\n\nSuggestion: link this issue as blocked by #3407. The maintainer decides.\n",
